h3. Context
* {{src/routes.ts:21}} {{registerRepo}} The repository id is stored with no character or path validation and later used as a directory name. An id such as {{../../etc}} escapes the repositories directory on both the template route and the cache listing route; an absolute path such as {{/etc}} escapes it on the cache listing route.
* {{src/routes.ts:36}} {{template}} The template route builds its base directory from the raw repository id.
